en.phrases is built by scripts/phrases from the same Google Books Ngram English Fiction release (2-grams and 3-grams,
books from 1980 on, CC BY 3.0 as above): for each word and pair of words, the words that most often follow them, with
their counts turned into probabilities.

nl.lexicon and nl.phrases (espanso-keyboard) are built by scripts/lexicon-nl and scripts/phrases-nl from two sources.

