Counts: OPUS OpenSubtitles v2018, Dutch monolingual text, https://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles/corpus/version/OpenSubtitles,
from P. Lison and J. Tiedemann, "OpenSubtitles2016: Extracting Large Parallel Corpora from Movie and TV Subtitles"
(LREC 2016), and http://www.opensubtitles.org/. OPUS publishes it without a licence of its own; nl.lexicon and nl.phrases
hold only counts derived from it (per word, and the likeliest next words after each word and pair of words).

